      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769288765000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks for holding, you've reached VeloFit. My name is Mike. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769288774533333
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi Mike. I'm calling to return a pair of mountain bike shoes I bought a while back.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 53911,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769288780466666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Can I get the email address on the account?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769288786199999
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. It's vip.customer@email.com.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 53911,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769288791933332
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. One moment... Okay, I see your account and the order for the shoes. And thank you for being a VIP member with us. It looks like you received these 54 days ago.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769288794733332
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, that sounds about right. I'd like to send them back if possible.",
