      "user_id": 53911,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769288819199998
    },
    {
      "text": "Not at all. I've just approved the return and I'm sending you a pre-paid **return label** to your email now. Since you're a VIP, I've also waived any restocking fees. Just print it out and drop the package off.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
